 "fields": {
  "title": "Reader test: core blocks",
  "URL": "https://jetpack.wpmt.co/reader-test-core-blocks/",
  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Every core block that can go in a post, so the shared stylesheet can be checked against all of them on one page.</p>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"heading-1\">Heading 1</h1>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"heading-2\">Heading 2</h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"heading-3\">Heading 3</h3>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"heading-4\">Heading 4</h4>\n\n\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Heading 5</h5>\n\n\n\n<h6 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Heading 6</h6>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Formatting: <strong>bold</strong>, <em>italic</em>, <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/\">a link</a>, <code>inline code</code>, <s>strikethrough</s>, <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>, x<sup>2</sup>, H<sub>2</sub>O, <mark style=\"background-color:#fcb900\" class=\"has-inline-color\">highlighted</mark>, <span class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color\">red text</span>, and a link to <a href=\"https://jetpack.wpmt.co/reader-test-core-blocks/#heading-3\">the third heading</a>. A footnote follows this sentence.<sup data-fn=\"8d4a0f6e-6c47-4d8a-9a3e-0c5f1b2e7a10\" class=\"fn\"><a href=\"https://jetpack.wpmt.co/reader-test-core-blocks/#8d4a0f6e-6c47-4d8a-9a3e-0c5f1b2e7a10\" id=\"8d4a0f6e-6c47-4d8a-9a3e-0c5f1b2e7a10-link\">1</a></sup> And another.<sup data-fn=\"3b9e2c71-1f5d-4b0a-8e6c-2d7f9a4b5c33\" class=\"fn\"><a href=\"https://jetpack.wpmt.co/reader-test-core-blocks/#3b9e2c71-1f5d-4b0a-8e6c-2d7f9a4b5c33\" id=\"3b9e2c71-1f5d-4b0a-8e6c-2d7f9a4b5c33-link\">2</a></sup></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-drop-cap wp-block-paragraph\">A paragraph with a drop cap. It needs to be long enough to wrap around the large first letter, so here are a few more words to make it wrap onto a second and third line on a phone.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Centred, large text.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>An unordered list</li>\n\n\n\n<li>With a nested list\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Nested item</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"3\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>An ordered list that starts at three</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Four</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A quote, with a citation.</p>\n<cite>Someone</cite></blockquote>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote\"><blockquote><p>A pullquote.</p><cite>Someone else</cite></blockquote></figure>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-verse\">A verse,\n    with its own line breaks\n        and indents.</pre>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-preformatted\">Preformatted text, which keeps     its spaces.</pre>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code>fn main() {\n    println!(\"A code block, with a line long enough that it has to scroll sideways on a phone screen.\");\n}</code></pre>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table is-style-stripes\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Header</th><th>Another header</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A striped</td><td>table</td></tr><tr><td>Second</td><td>row</td></tr><tr><td>Third</td><td>row</td></tr></tbody><tfoot><tr><td>Footer</td><td>row</td></tr></tfoot></table><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">A table caption</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>A wide table with many columns</td><td>Two</td><td>Three</td><td>Four</td><td>Five</td><td>Six</td><td>Seven</td><td>Eight</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-dots\">\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wordpress.org/\">A button</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--2\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wordpress.org/\">An outline button</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-3a88641f wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The first of two columns.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The second of two columns.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2eadce09 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"background-color:#f0f0f0;padding-top:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:20px\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A group with a background colour and padding.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"650\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?resize=1200%2C650&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-143 size-full\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?resize=300%2C163&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?resize=1024%2C555&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?resize=768%2C416&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\"></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Media and text.</p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\"></span><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"650\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-144\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-50.jpg?resize=1200%2C650&amp;ssl=1\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-50.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-50.jpg?resize=300%2C163&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-50.jpg?resize=1024%2C555&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-50.jpg?resize=768%2C416&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\"><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-cover-is-layout-constrained\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">A cover with an image</p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-48.jpg?ssl=1\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"650\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-48.jpg?resize=1200%2C650&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"An image linked to its file\" class=\"wp-image-142\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-48.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-48.jpg?resize=300%2C163&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-48.jpg?resize=1024%2C555&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-48.jpg?resize=768%2C416&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\"></a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">An image, linked to its file, with a caption</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignright size-medium\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"650\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?resize=1200%2C650&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"A right-aligned image\" class=\"wp-image-143\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?resize=300%2C163&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?resize=1024%2C555&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?resize=768%2C416&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Text that wraps around the right-aligned image, long enough to show whether it wraps on a phone or the image takes the whole width.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-full\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"650\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-50.jpg?resize=1200%2C650&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"A wide image\" class=\"wp-image-144\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-50.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-50.jpg?resize=300%2C163&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-50.jpg?resize=1024%2C555&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-50.jpg?resize=768%2C416&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-48.jpg?ssl=1\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"650\" data-id=\"142\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-48.jpg?resize=1200%2C650&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-142\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-48.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-48.jpg?resize=300%2C163&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-48.jpg?resize=1024%2C555&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-48.jpg?resize=768%2C416&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\"></a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">First</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?ssl=1\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"650\" data-id=\"143\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?resize=1200%2C650&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-143\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?resize=300%2C163&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?resize=1024%2C555&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?resize=768%2C416&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\"></a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Second</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-50.jpg?ssl=1\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"650\" data-id=\"144\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-50.jpg?resize=1200%2C650&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-144\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-50.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-50.jpg?resize=300%2C163&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-50.jpg?resize=1024%2C555&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-50.jpg?resize=768%2C416&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\"></a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Third</figcaption></figure>\n<figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-caption wp-element-caption\">A gallery caption</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls src=\"https://jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reader-test-audio.m4a\" preload=\"none\"></audio><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">An audio block</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video\"><video controls poster=\"https://jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-48.jpg\" preload=\"none\" src=\"https://download.blender.org/peach/bigbuckbunny_movies/BigBuckBunny_320x180.mp4\"></video><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">A video block, with a poster</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a id=\"wp-block-file--media-reader-test\" href=\"https://jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reader-test-file.pdf\">reader-test-file</a><a href=\"https://jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reader-test-file.pdf\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download aria-describedby=\"wp-block-file--media-reade